C LIMIT 1` or `SELECT rowid FROM facts WHERE id = ?`.\n  - [`_resolve_anchor`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L248-L274): Queries `SELECT t.name, t.ts, t.fact_cursor FROM ticks t JOIN facts f ON f.id = t.fact_cursor WHERE ... AND f.rowid \u003c= ? ORDER BY f.rowid DESC, t.rowid DESC LIMIT 1` to construct [`TickAnchor`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L148-L162).\n  - [`_resolve_witness_position_on_conn`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L276-L330): Constructs [`WitnessPosition`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L165-L196) with `(fact_id, rowid, seq, lineage, unadopted, anchor, store)`.\n  - [`resolve_witness_position`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L332-L391): Public entry point instantiating `WitnessPosition`.\n  - [`resolve_cut_summary`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L422-L464): Constructs [`CutSummary`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L394-L420) from atomic position, tick total, and `anchor_seq`.\n  - [`resolve_seq`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L674-L704): Maps `seq:N` receipt ordinal to fact id via `SELECT id FROM facts ORDER BY rowid LIMIT 1 OFFSET ?`.\n  - [`resolve_tick_cursor`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L714-L758): Maps `tick:ID` to `(fact_cursor, name, ts)` via `SELECT name, ts, fact_cursor FROM ticks WHERE id = ?`.\n  - [`resolve_tick_floor`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L767-L808): Maps wall-clock timestamp to `(fact_cursor, name, ts)` via `SELECT t.name, t.ts, t.fact_cursor FROM ticks t JOIN facts f ON f.id = t.fact_cursor WHERE t.ts \u00