docs/scratch/arrival-branch-review/codex-r1-stderr.log:15564:docs/scratch/arrival-sliceB/explore/e1-catchup.json:1:{"conversation_id":"3b094118-8081-4fe6-b09c-427538c4e165","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### 1. Definitions of `catch_up` (and variants) and `_rebuild` (and rebuild/reindex variants)\n\nIn the engine store layer (`libs/engine/src/engine/` and `libs/store/src/store/`):\n\n* **`catch_up`**:\n  * [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:226-276`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L226-L276) — `def catch_up(self) -\u003e str:` in `ArrivalStore`\n  * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:674-731`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L674-L731) — `def catch_up(self) -\u003e str:` in `JsonlStore`\n  * *No `_catch_up` variants found.*\n\n* **`_rebuild` / `rebuild` / `reindex` variants**:\n  * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:939-967`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L939-L967) — `def _rebuild(self, reason: str) -\u003e None:` in `JsonlStore`\n  * [`libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py:210-267`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py#L210-L267) — `def rebuild_jsonl(source: Path, target: Path) -\u003e RebuildResult:`\n  * [`libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py:465-517`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L465-L517) — `def vertex_reindex(vertex_path: Path) -\u003e dict[str, Any]:`\n  * [`libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py:520-551`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L520-L551) — `def _reindex_aggregate(ast: Any, vertex_path: Path) -\u003e dict[str, Any]:`\n\n---\n\n### 2. Every Call Site of Each\n\n#### `ArrivalStore.catch_up`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:157`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L157) — inside `ArrivalStore.__init__`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:323`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L323) — inside `ArrivalStore._reconcile`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:389`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L389) — inside `ArrivalStore._write`\n\n#### `JsonlStore.catch_up`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:469`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L469) — inside `JsonlStore._open_index` (called during `__init__` via `_open_index` / `_recover_index`)\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:624`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L624) — inside `JsonlStore._reconcile`\n\n#### `JsonlStore._rebuild`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:694`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L694) — inside `JsonlStore.catch_up` (when `offset is None`)\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:700`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L700) — inside `JsonlStore.catch_up` (when offset is outside `0..size`)\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:703`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L703) — inside `JsonlStore.catch_up` (when prefix is not intact)\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:727`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L727) — inside `JsonlStore.catch_up` (on `_RowAlreadyIndexed` exception during `_tail_forward`)\n\n#### `rebuild_jsonl`\n* [`libs/store/src/store/__init__.py:12`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/__init__.py#L12) — re-exported in package namespace\n\n#### `vertex_reindex` / `_reindex_aggregate`\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_rea