   632	        Same posture as ``_fact_sig_ready`` / ``_facts_have_signature_column``:
   633	        the positive result is cached (adopting ``_chain_ready``, which then
   634	        correctly no-ops ``_ensure_chain_columns``); a legacy schema re-probes.
